  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><img src=\"https://warhammercraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/BannerNoUnofficial-1.png\" width=\"1110\" height=\"167\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">-</span><br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><em>在 Minecraft 中一磚一瓦構築舊世界！</em></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">收錄了 WarhammerCraft 伺服器所使用的模組，包含 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warhammercraft-aethyr\" rel=\"nofollow\">WarhammerCraft: Aethyr</a> 自訂方塊模組。<br> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們致力於精準還原《戰鎚奇幻》宇宙中的舊世界大陸。<strong>WarhammerCraft</strong> 伺服器是 Minecraft 中極致非官方的戰鎚奇幻重現體驗！</span></span></h2>\n<h2><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">玩家可以飛行遊覽並欣賞我們的成果，或申請加入我們出色的建築團隊。</span><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">無論您是戰鎚粉絲、喜歡在巨大地圖上建造壯觀城堡，或是單純熱愛 Minecraft，WarhammerCraft 都開放給所有人探索。</span></span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://warhammercraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/LogoLarge.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"256\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>我們始終招募建築師加入我們！ |<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>請瀏覽下方網站並點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwarhammercraft.com%252fapplytobuild%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong> 申請成為建築師</strong></a>加入。<br></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwarhammercraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>網站</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/warhammercraft_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Twitter</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fwarhammercraft%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Planet Minecraft</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252ff2dSs5R\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Discord</span></strong></a></span></p>",
